<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Vim on Barim's blog · ابراهيم</title><link>https://barim.us/tags/vim/</link><description>Recent content in Vim on Barim's blog · ابراهيم</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 10:23:48 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://barim.us/tags/vim/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Convert multiple files to utf8 using vim</title><link>https://barim.us/post/2014-12-03-convert-multiple-files-to-utf8-using-vim/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2014 18:44:07 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://barim.us/post/2014-12-03-convert-multiple-files-to-utf8-using-vim/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The fastest and more efficient way to batch multiple files encoding conversion :&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight full-width-content"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;vim +&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;argdo se fileencoding=utf-8 | w | bnext&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; +&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;q&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="sb"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt; find . -type f -name &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;*.rsp&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;+&amp;ldquo;argdo&amp;rdquo; : execute the following vim commands for each file (filencode, save and next buffer)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>